summary:
  The player's error does not reach the watch.

history:
  Measured 2026-11-12: a station that closes the connection is reported by
  the player at once (-5), a second before the last sound. With the error
  as a witness the stream is handed on five seconds after the position
  stopped, and the sound was back 10 s after the close; without it the
  wait is the full twenty.

target:
  package/contents/ui/StandWatch.qml

find:
  function onErrorOccurred() { watch._erred(Date.now()); }

replace:
  function onErrorOccurred() { }

expect:
  Killed by tst_standwatch::test_the_players_own_error_signal_is_the_one_heard.
  Line-neutral.
